{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本不揭出天王已下四人及節度等註文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "潭州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本德山之上有龍潭派世系圖一行，並四世。龍潭崇信，及渚宮人，賣餅家子，未詳姓氏。常日以十餅饋悟和尚，悟每受食畢，留一餅曰：吾惠汝以蔭子孫。師自念曰：餅是我持去，何以返遺我耶？遂問悟曰：是汝持來，復汝何咎？師領玄旨，遂投出家。悟曰：汝昔崇善，今信我言，可名崇信。由是服勤契旨，嗣道悟之註，而置曹洞派之次。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "衡州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "福州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "婺州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "京洛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "台州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本龍華在保安下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "江州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南嶽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本揭出明招等七人于安州穆下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本為三角志操東禪興陽白兆新羅慧日之順次。又上欄在慧真幽閑文責及已上三人，按符󳬴嗣道悟之註書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本四世為五世，已下遞次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "興元"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本五世為一世，已下遞次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "汝州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "池州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鎮州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本九世為五世，已下遞次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十一世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本揭出上藍等二人于薦福之次"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍白水九頂進本位次前後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍竹園駙馬進本位次前后"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍雙林文公進本位次前後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本次第：楊岐、黃龍、翠巖、育王道場與此相反。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本十二世為八世，已下󳯝次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十四世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十五世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十六世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本十二世為八世，已下遞次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十四世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十五世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十六世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "號懶庵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廬山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本揭出萬壽等五人于廣教下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十六世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本十六世為十二世，已下󳯝次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十七世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十八世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十九世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本十二世為八世，已下󳯝次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十四世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法裔別見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十四世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本十四世為十世，已下遞次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十五世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十六世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法裔別見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍秘進本作權"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十六世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本十六世為十二世，已下遞次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十七世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十八世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本二十世為十六世，已下󳯝次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十一世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十二世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十三世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍笑隱仲方間進本，有梅屋念常纂修佛祖通載十字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍閒進本作聞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本空巖右側在十六世三字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十六世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本十六世為十二世，已下󳯝次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十七世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十八世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十八世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本十八世為十四世，已下󳯝次準之。○○密菴作天童。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十九世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "號破庵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十一世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十二世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍銕牛下進本為默翁、海印、陡涯、銕山、無極及庵、銕牛、虗谷之列次"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本揭出斷橋于雪巖之前，有台州黃岩徐氏子，十八落髮無準，堂中聞板聲大悟，臨終集眾與魏國公問答，書偈而化之注。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍竹屋下進本，為永宗、雪山、絕象、竹山、竹屋、藏室、古田之順次。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本月坡在指西之後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本揭出無學于雪巖之次，○列高峯于方外之後。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本退耕下插入簡翁敬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本揭出西岩于松麓之前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本古林在斷江之後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本龍翔在雲巢之後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本竺西坦在虎巖之後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十二世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本二十二世作十八世，已下󳯝次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十三世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十四世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十五世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十六世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本無念列寶峯之次"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本右有十八世三字，左繼席瑞岩四字。○無見右有十九世三字，左台之仙居葉氏子，元統甲戌五月二日示寂，諡妙明真覺，塔曰寂光之注。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本右有二十世三字，左處州麗水吳氏子。洪武己酉應召，尋隱福林，茶毗獲舍利無數，塔于院西。師平日隨機開導，偈頌法語，不容人錄之注。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本右有二十一世四字，左松陵人，受業日鑄，壽八十一之注。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十六世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本二十六世為二十一世，已下遞次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十七世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十八世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十九世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本天柱列古芳之下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本無相法嗣下插入慧堂謙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本為心印天印無相之列次"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別號玉芝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本孤峯列古庵之下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本順作頥。○行菴列別峯之下。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本有以上按天順甲申少林󳬴載佛祖宗派圖，無際悟下補人四十八人，又考續燈補入二十二人之文字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本三十世為二十六世，已下遞次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十一世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十二世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十三世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十四世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十四世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十五世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十六世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十七世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍進本七世為一世，已下遞次準之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法裔別見"}
